      "help_en": "<props=\"china\">The billing method of the NAT gateway instance that you want to query. Valid values:</props>\n\n<props=\"china\">\nPostPaid: pay-as-you-go.</props>\nPrePaid: the legacy subscription billing method. New purchases under the subscription billing method are no longer supported.\n\n</props>\n\n<props=\"intl\">The billing method of the NAT gateway instance that you want to query. Valid value: PostPaid (pay-as-you-go).</props>",
      "help_zh": "<props=\"china\">要查询的NAT网关实例的付费模式，取值：</props>\n\n<props=\"china\">\nPostPaid：按量付费。</props>\nPrePaid：存量包年包月付费模式。目前包年包月付费模式已停止新购。\n\n</props>\n\n<props=\"intl\">要查询的NAT网关实例的付费模式，取值：PostPaid（按量付费）。</props>",
